00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.830
because it's not always because of earwax.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.270
There's true issues with hearing,

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:34.380
especially these days,

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:37.110
with everyone blasting
their music with earbuds.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.390
That literally could
be early hearing loss,

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.440
and that's a real problem.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.260
That's why I really recommend
not listening to your music

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:46.260
over 50, 60% max volume.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.360
