00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:25.200
How does that make sense from
an advertising perspective?

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.670
I don't like a lot of these products

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.890
where you're chewing very heavily,

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.840
'cause you're using the
masseter jaw muscle.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:31.673
Yes.

00:08:31.673 --> 00:08:33.480
But remember, a lot of the shape

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.980
that comes from your jawline,

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.390
