00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.880
It comes from the bone and
structure that's already formed.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.740
It has nothing to do with the muscle.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.689
So yeah, while you can
exercise the muscle,

00:08:42.689 --> 00:08:45.240
