00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:47.640
Do you know what happens when
you have a sore masseter?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.410
Pain in the TMJ area.
(bell ringing)

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:50.670
Grinding at night
(bell ringing)

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:51.690
while you're sleeping.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.660
So many issues can arise
when it comes to dental care,

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.670
when you have an over-trained masseter.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.350
I would not recommend this product.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.780
Even just the claim, "Not for the weak,"

